  "description": "The massive debt left behind by his parents and the interest snowballing every month. Despite needing money and a place to live, Hee-won hides his true nature and gets a job at the \"Alpha-Only Sauna\" run by Ki Taebeom, the man who saved him...\n\n\"You said you were a Beta. You have a omega hole?\"\n\nThe secret gap nestled between his legs.\n\nOf all people, he had his Omega hole discovered by the very boss who hired him, Ki Taebeom.\n\n\"This... isn't a pussy!\" \"Then what?\"\n\n\"It's a scar from when I was young. It's just... a slightly larger scar...\"\n\nHe couldn't be kicked out like this now that his Omega identity had been revealed. When he denied it, Boss Ki nodded as if beckoning him over.\n\n\"Little one, come here and spread your legs.\"\n\n\"...Huh?\"\n\nAs Heewon hesitated in fear, A rough, coarse hand pulled him closer.\n\n\"I'm going to put some ointment on you.\"\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13842732)",
